{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Verde and the Echoing Water is a cozy city management game with a focus on the environment. Build the town of Dewdrop Valley, Supply water to the townsfolk, and restore harmony to the town of Dewdrop Valley! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build the town!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help the townsfolk build a sustainable town in this drought ravaged land. Build up structures and facilities to create a beautiful bustling community built around nature. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164310/extras/ezgif-6321acca85212f.gif?t=1742813002\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customize the look of your town!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put your own spin to the look of Dewdrop Valley by customizing each building to the preferences of the townsfolk!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164310/extras/ezgif-649e86a3d73b73.gif?t=1742813002\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discover the different regions of Dewdrop Valley!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore and build the unique regions of Dewdrop Valley. Each region comes with it's own unique look and challenges to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164310/extras/ezgif-62bf1969acd76a.gif?t=1742813002\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3164310?t=1742813002","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3164310?t=1742813002","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164310/f9a9d14b97190b7d51f5be1b1b0d473fc2fdfa8b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742813002","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164310/f9a9d14b97190b7d51f5be1b1b0d473fc2fdfa8b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742813002","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Verde and the Echoing Water is a cozy city management game with a focus on the environment. Build the town of Dewdrop Valley, Supply water to the townsfolk, and restore harmony to the town of Dewdrop Valley! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build the town!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help the townsfolk build a sustainable town in this drought ravaged land. Build up structures and facilities to create a beautiful bustling community built around nature. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164310/extras/ezgif-6321acca85212f.gif?t=1742813002\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customize the look of your town!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put your own spin to the look of Dewdrop Valley by customizing each building to the preferences of the townsfolk!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164310/extras/ezgif-649e86a3d73b73.gif?t=1742813002\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discover the different regions of Dewdrop Valley!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore and build the unique regions of Dewdrop Valley. Each region comes with it's own unique look and challenges to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164310/extras/ezgif-62bf1969acd76a.gif?t=1742813002\" /></p>","developers":["Antimeta Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164310/header.jpg?t=1742813002","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlig